&lt;h6 class="smt_head5" style="padding-left:18pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:9pt;"&gt;（金属加工機械事業）&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text4" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;売上収益は&lt;span&gt;334,617百万円&lt;/span&gt;（&lt;span&gt;前期比11.0％増&lt;/span&gt;）、営業利益は&lt;span&gt;48,430百万円&lt;/span&gt;（&lt;span&gt;前期比16.7％増&lt;/span&gt;）となりました。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:54pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text4" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;＜板金部門＞&lt;/p&gt;
